		(property "Note" "HARNESS (stock score jack '50', bottom edge): Molex 95503-2441 4P4C low-profile TOP-ENTRY jack (JLC C588833) = the stock part: Molex SD-95503-003 (datasheets/955032661_sd.pdf) body '95003', mfg ID 'MXCH' as on the stock jacks; 4 POS: 11.18 wide, posts 7.62 apart 4.96 behind the front face, tails 6.35 / 8.89 behind the posts = the scanned stock pads (Q-46); plug from above (owner 2026-10-27); in parallel with J11 (SC_50); contacts 1 = +5V_JACK (+5V_SYS via the 0.5 A PTC), 2 = score, 3 = NC, 4 = GND (owner continuity 2026-10-27)"
