		(property "Note" "UVLO divider (SLVSE57C 9.2.2.2, Eq. 1) with R2 47k: rising typ 1.2 V x (1 + 100k / 47k) = 3.75 V; worst high (VUVLO(R) max 1.27 V, both 1 %, IEN 0.1 uA x 101k) 4.04 V, worst low 3.48 V; falling (1.03-1.17 V) 3.17-3.72 V, typ 3.44 V. Was 39k (worst rising 4.60 V = the LPV-60-5 -8 % floor, adversarial review F04 2026-10-27). +5V_SYS loads run from 2.5 V (U2 TLV62569 / U8 MAX98357A 2.5-5.5 V, U4 TPS2553 2.5-6.5 V)"
