		(property "Note" "HARNESS (stock J11 location: score-sensor harness '25512 CE'): PLAIN unshrouded 1x9 2.54 mm vertical pin header like the stock J11 (owner 2026-10-27: the stock plug has ribbed finger-grip ears and friction-fits a plain header; the earlier KK 254 friction-lock wall did not match it, Q-48). Standard 11.5 mm pin (3.0 tail / 2.5 insulator / 6.0 mating). Square pad = pin 1 = the '*' end (owner back photo) = the switches' common = GND (owner continuity); pins 2-9 = the 8 inputs. Pads at x 48.27 .. 68.57 (pin 1 at 68.6), y 65.0. Hole-to-pin order = firmware"
